    "created_at": "2026-11-12T20:47:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-12T20:47:14Z",
    "body": "> We should add AllowedHIDDevice/HIDPermissionStorage for WebHID.\n\nAfter I left this comment I noticed that we already considered this for WebSerial (https://github.com/whatwg/serial/issues/107#issuecomment-4149211776) and decided against adding `SerialPermissionStorage`. Instead it's left to the user agent to decide how to store permissions. I think it's reasonable to take a similar approach here if Firefox isn't planning to integrate HID permissions with Permissions API.",
